[
  {
    "pkheadingid": 703,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Definition",
    "headingPosition": 1,
    "headingid": 466,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107451,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 466,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Anaplastic sarcoma of the kidney (ASK) is a multipatterned cystic and solid sarcoma with anaplasia. It is regarded as part of the <em>DICER1</em> spectrum of tumours.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 704,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "ICD-O coding",
    "headingPosition": 2,
    "headingid": 467,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107452,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 467,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>8802/3 Anaplastic sarcoma of the kidney</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 705,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "ICD-11 coding",
    "headingPosition": 3,
    "headingid": 468,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107453,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 468,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>2C90.Y &amp; XH4UM7 Other specified malignant neoplasms of kidney, except renal pelvis &amp; Sarcoma, NOS</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 706,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Related terminology",
    "headingPosition": 4,
    "headingid": 469,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107454,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 469,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Acceptable:</em> <em>DICER1</em> sarcoma of the kidney.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 707,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 470,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107455,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 470,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 708,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 471,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107456,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 471,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>ASK is localized in the kidney, but tumours with similar features have been described in other organs (pleuropulmonary blastoma {31527943}).</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 709,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 472,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107457,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 472,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>ASK usually manifests as a large renal mass. Some patients present with flank pain and haematuria.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 710,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 473,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107458,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 473,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>ASK is extremely rare, with &lt;&nbsp;30&nbsp;cases published in the English-language literature. Patient age at presentation ranges from 10&nbsp;months to 41&nbsp;years (median: 9.4&nbsp;years), and about 70% of patients are aged &lt;&nbsp;15&nbsp;years {17895746; 32368542}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 711,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 474,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107459,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 474,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>ASK is associated with <em>DICER1</em> pathogenic variants.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 712,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 475,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107460,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 475,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Similarly to how purely cystic (type&nbsp;I) pleuropulmonary blastoma in the lung shows potential to progress to cystic and solid (type&nbsp;II) pleuropulmonary blastoma, cystic nephroma of the kidney can progress to anaplastic sarcoma {27036314; 26928971; 24481001}. Like in pleuropulmonary blastoma, in some cases of ASK there are biallelic loss-of-function and missense RNase&nbsp;IIIb mutations in <em>DICER1</em>. This combination of mutations is expected to alter expression of microRNAs important in regulating the cell cycle and limiting differentiation {24909177}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 719,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 482,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107461,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 482,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>ASK is typically large (median diameter: 150&nbsp;mm) and located centrally in the kidney. Many tumours have a distinct cystic component {17895746; 32368542}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 713,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 476,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107462,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 476,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>ASK is a multipatterned sarcoma with cystic and solid sarcomatous components. The predominant pattern is spindle cell sarcoma with scattered large cells that have large hyperchromatic and irregular nuclei and enlarged multipolar anaplastic figures. Malignant cartilage nodules and embryonal rhabdomyosarcomatous areas can also be seen. Residual cystic nephroma can be seen at the periphery of the tumours {17895746; 24481001}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 714,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 477,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107463,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 477,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 715,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 478,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107464,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 478,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>ASK has biallelic <em>DICER1</em> loss-of-function and missense RNase&nbsp;IIIb pathogenic variants {24481001; 28862265}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 718,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 481,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107465,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 481,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> a multipatterned sarcoma containing spindle cell sarcoma, cartilage, and diffuse anaplasia, with or without a residual cystic nephroma.</p>\r\n<p><em>Desirable:</em> biallelic <em>DICER1</em> pathogenic sequence variants in tumour tissue.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 716,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 479,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107466,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 479,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>No separate staging system exists for ASK, but the International Society of Paediatric Oncology (SIOP) or Children&rsquo;s Oncology Group (COG) staging systems may be used {26304882; 30310143}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 717,
    "bookid": 44,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 480,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 107467,
        "bookId": 44,
        "chapterId": 417,
        "headingId": 480,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Follow-up is limited in these cases. In reported cases, the overall survival rate is 75% {17895746; 32368542}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2023-03-09T11:08:36"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]